# Environment files - NEVER commit secrets
.env
.env.local
# NOTE: application.properties is intentionally NOT ignored anymore.
# It contains only the ${DATABASE_URL} placeholder (no hardcoded secrets),
# so it's safe to commit. Actual credentials come from the DATABASE_URL env var.